s of this country have figured  that out other parts of this country are  still in the dark ages and that is truly  horrifying and scary and I don't know if  I should be pleased that two-thirds of  the parents in hepzibah Georgia didn't  sign the paddling consent form or  horrified that one third did I lean  towards being horrified that one third  did
 

